def str9 : String := "{\"basis\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:basis\",\"context\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:context:source-first-proposal\",\"id\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:record:740591d30370a65f48fcebfec32179ad\",\"owner\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:actor:f-p-author\",\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:scope:source-corpus\"],\"sort\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:sort:authored-concept\",\"value\":{\"conditions\":[\"The selected engagement has the Product-composition scope described by this clause.\"],\"definition\":\"An edge records source/target capability, exact basis, existing authorities, eligible information, actual operations, lifecycle and return conditions without manufacturing a grant.\",\"exceptions\":[],\"grounding\":[{\"end_line\":916,\"path\":\"standards/PRODUCT_DEFINITION.md\",\"quote\":\"### PC-03 — The edge's contract and authority record\\n\\nFor each directed relation, the `relation` authority and referenced `contracts`\\nstate, directly or by exact reference:\\n\\n1. Source and target Product identities and roles; the consumed capability,\\n   outcome, purpose, selected basis and currentness policy.\\n2. The existing owners and grants for each material operation: acquisition,\\n   disclosure, use, execution, mutation, assessment and disposition. A kind or\\n   role label records no grant by itself.\\n3. Admissible inputs and exports; material assumptions, effects, failures,\\n   obligations and evidence; restrictions on implementation material and derived\\n   information where applicable.\\n4. The acting principals or binding rule, task/phase scope, permitted delegation,\\n   return consumer, stop/refusal conditions and revocation/invalidation route.\\n\\nThese coordinates may be supplied by source-linked prose. The relation locates\\nand constrains lawfully granted authority; it cannot manufacture the target's\\npermission or the source's admission. Missing material authority or an unresolved\\nconflict withholds the dependent action. The execution-scoped activation remains\\nthe place where a particular actor, input, effect and return are bound.\",\"section\":\"repo://stdo-v3.0.2-source/PRODUCT_DEFINITION.md#pc-03--the-edges-contract-and-authority-record\",\"start_line\":895}],\"label\":\"Edge authority and capability contract\"}}"

